-A convolutional autoencoder network that compresses multivariate volume slices into a compact representation and reconstructs them, enabling real-time rendering of large time-varying volumes by storing only the compressed representation on GPU memory. This method uses deep learning to learn a latent space representation, offering high compression ratios for complex, non-linear data structures at the cost of training time and inference overhead.
